#: kpgp.cpp:577
msgid ""
"You didn't select an encryption key for the recipient of this message. "
"Therefore the message will not be encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Ni ddewisoch allwedd gêl-ysgrifo ar gyfer derbyniwr y neges yma.  Felly ni "
"chêl-ysgrifir y neges."

#: kpgp.cpp:580
msgid ""
"You didn't select an encryption key for any of the recipients of this "
"message. Therefore the message will not be encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Ni ddewisoch allwedd gêl-ysgrifo ar gyfer derbynwyr y neges yma.  Felly ni "
"chêl-ysgrifir y neges."

#: kpgp.cpp:596
msgid ""
"You didn't select an encryption key for one of the recipients. This person "
"will not be able to decrypt the message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Ni ddewisoch allwedd gêl-ysgrifo ar gyfer un o dderbynwyr y neges yma.  Ni "
"fydd y person yma yn gallu datgelu'r neges os y'i chêl-ysgrifir."

#: kpgp.cpp:599
msgid ""
"You didn't select encryption keys for some of the recipients. These persons "
"will not be able to decrypt the message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Ni ddewisoch allwedd gêl-ysgrifo ar gyfer rhai o dderbynwyr y neges yma.  "
"Ni fydd y bobl yma yn gallu datgelu'r neges os y'i chêl-ysgrifir."

#: kpgp.cpp:871
msgid ""
"This feature is\n"
"still missing"
msgstr ""
"Ni chynhelir\n"
"y nodwedd yma eto."

#: kpgp.cpp:919 kpgp.cpp:954 kpgp.cpp:990
msgid "You either don't have GnuPG/PGP installed or you chose not to use GnuPG/PGP."
msgstr ""
"Unai nid yw GnuPG/PGP wedi'i osod, neu rydywch wedi dewis peidio â gwneud "
"GnuPG/PGP."

#: kpgp.cpp:1205 kpgp.cpp:1269 kpgp.cpp:1295 kpgpui.cpp:1506 kpgpui.cpp:1518
msgid "Encryption Key Selection"
msgstr "Dewis Allwedd Cêl-ysgrifo"

#: kpgp.cpp:1209
msgid ""
"_: if in your language something like 'key(s)' isn't possible please use the "
"plural in the translation\n"
"There is a problem with the encryption key(s) for \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Please re-select the key(s) which should be used for this recipient."
msgstr ""
"Mae problem efo'r allwedd(au) cêl-ysgrifo ar gyfer \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Ail-ddewiswch yr allwedd(au) a ddylir eu defnyddio ar gyfer y derbyniwr yma."

#: kpgp.cpp:1273
